    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Entry points",
      "items": [
        "scripts/analyze_supply_chain.py exposes 11 subcommands; generate_synthetic_data.py writes 20 tables (line 182)",
        "FastAPI mounts one router: GET /api/v1/health, /health/live, /health/ready (backend/app/main.py:27)",
        "frontend/index.html is static — no HTTP calls or fetch/XHR anywhere"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Analytics engine",
      "items": [
        "All 10 analytics packages execute inside the CLI, not behind HTTP",
        "Acyclic: datasets → features → forecasting → reports → inventory → {procurement, simulation} → replay",
        "analytics/replay imports only inventory.types and the public simulation API (replay/replay.py:36,50)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Boundaries and gaps",
      "items": [
        "docs/api-contract.md documents 44 endpoints; 41 do not exist in code",
        "backend/app/schemas, repositories and integration are imported by nothing",
        "lifespan runs Base.metadata.create_all instead of alembic upgrade (core/lifespan.py:9)"
      ]
    }
